Looking at the actual source region from the failure:
```javascript
    // Esc
    case 27:
      // Clear "input" value
      ctx.input.value = "";

      /**
       * @emit {clear} event on input clear
       **/
      eventEmitter('clear', ctx);

      close(ctx);
      break;
```

